=2 Walkthrough
* Make sure you do not leave without picking up a few {i:Pickaxe|Pickaxe|605}.
* Speak to {n:Dkhaaya} for a cutscene and to obtain {k:Dkhaaya's research journal}.
* Enter {z:Aydeewa Subterrane} through the cave at (I-7) in {z:Bhaflau Thickets}.
** It is a short trek north if exiting {p:Whitegate} at (G/H-7).
* Head to the room at (H-9) and begin mine in this room until you find one of three key items; {k:Electrocell}, {k:Electropot}, or {k:Electrolocomotive}.
** This is the same room where you finish the {q:Blue Mage Flag Quest|An Empty Vessel|Blue Mage Flag Quest}.
*** Be aware that approaching the platform will complete this quest and warp you back to {p:Whitegate}.
* Return to {n:Dkhaaya} who will reward you with a {i:Lightning Band|Lightning Band|2217}.
* At this point the quest is completed, however, if you trade the {i:Lightning Band|Lightning Band|2217} to the **Leypoint** at {z:Wajaom Woodlands} (G-8) it will transform into an {i:Olduum Ring|Olduum Ring|15769}.

=3 Repeating the Quest
If you drop your {i:Olduum Ring|Olduum Ring|15769}, speak to {n:Dkhaaya} to repeat the quest.
